Subject: Open RAR archives read-only through libarchive

libarchive reads RAR 4 and RAR 5 archives natively, with no external
program, but Ark offers RAR only to its unrar and unarchiver plugins,
which need the unrar or lsar executables. Without them Ark lists RAR as
supported and then fails with "No suitable plugin found". Listing
application/vnd.rar in the read-only libarchive plugin lets Ark open,
browse and extract RAR archives wherever libarchive is built; the unrar
plugin's higher priority keeps it the choice when unrar is installed.

--- a/plugins/libarchive/kerfuffle_libarchive_readonly.json.cmake
+++ b/plugins/libarchive/kerfuffle_libarchive_readonly.json.cmake
@@ -77,7 +77,8 @@
             "application/x-xar",
             "application/x-iso9660-appimage",
             "application/x-archive",
-            "application/x-msdownload"
+            "application/x-msdownload",
+            "application/vnd.rar"
         ],
         "Name": "Libarchive plugin (read-only formats)",
         "Name[ar]": "ملحق Libarchive (تنسيقات قراءة فقط)",
